---
// About section with content, image, and founder description in 3 columns.
---
<section class="cs-about-sec py-lg-0 py-5" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 order-lg-1 order-1">
        <!-- Bistly Content Box -->
        <div class="bistly-content-box mb-lg-0 mb-5 text-center text-lg-start" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
          <h2>About Us</h2>
          <p>At Brew Haven, coffee is more than a drink it's a ritual. Since 2015, we've blended quality beans, community vibes &amp; expert brewing to serve moments that matter.</p>
          <div class="bistly-button">
            <a href="#about" class="theme-btn style-one">Read More</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 order-lg-2 order-3">
        <!-- Bistly Image -->
        <div class="bistly-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/home-coffee/about/about-img1.webp" alt="Brew Haven coffee shop">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 order-lg-3 order-2">
        <!-- CS Text Box -->
        <div class="text-box mb-lg-0 mb-5 text-center text-lg-start" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1200">
          <h2>John Smith</h2>
          <span class="position">CEO &amp; Founder</span>
          <p>John Smith is the heart and mind behind Brew Haven. With over a decade of experience in the coffee industry.</p>
          <p>When he's not cupping the latest bean roast, you'll find him chatting with regulars.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
